    "x-shillinq-note": "Declares the `shillinq` register itself. OpenRegister's ImportHandler creates a Register row ONLY from `components.registers` (ImportHandler::importFromApp -> the `$data['components']['registers']` loop) and from nowhere else on the `main`/`beta` lines that shillinq's CI pins. Without this block a clean install created 493 schemas and ZERO registers, and then skipped all 144 seed objects, whose `@self.register` is resolved through the registersMap this block populates -- and every `GET /apps/openregister/api/objects/shillinq/<schema>` answered HTTP 404 `Register not found: 'shillinq'`. Kept as its own register.d fragment (ADR-037) rather than edited into shillinq_register.json so concurrent per-change fragments never conflict with it. NOTE: entries below are schema SLUGS (the value ImportHandler keys `schemasMap` by, via `$schema->getSlug()`), not `components.schemas` object keys -- for shillinq the two coincide, but they do not in every app. This file deliberately does NOT set `info.version`: several register.d fragments do, and the last one alphabetically wins the deep merge.",
